1746 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Capstone Project\nNew Paradigm for XR Text Input \nDesigned a new interaction paradigm for text input in XR\054 rethinking current high\055friction methods through faster\054 multimodal alternatives\056\n\042 Identified text input as XR\047s highest\055friction task through a competitive teardown of 4 input methods\n\042 Observed 8 Vision Pro and Quest users and ran interviews to map real\055world friction patterns\n\042 Prototyped 3 interaction concepts in Xcode\054 converging on a multimodal model that pairs predictive AI with gaze\055led targeting\n\042 Validated the model with 10 users in usability testing)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1747 0 R
     /Pg 1732 0 R
